### 🔁 Recap Checklist

| Scaling Level | What it Scales | Triggered By | Ideal For |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Manual** | Replicas (Pods) | Human Admin | Planned events & testing |
| **HPA** | Replicas (Pods) | Metric Thresholds (CPU/RAM) | Live traffic spikes |
| **Cluster Autoscaler** | VM Nodes (Hardware) | Pending Pods (No capacity) | Infrastructure elasticity |
